<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Jesus Himself drew near,</l><l>They were no longer sad;</l><l>When He was walking at their side,</l><l>How could they but be glad?</l><l>Draw near, O Lord.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Jesus Himself drew near,</l><l>And all their doubts were solved;</l><l>He showed them why Christ came to die,</l><l>And what that death involved:</l><l>Draw near, O Lord.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Jesus Himself drew near,</l><l>And at the journey’s end</l><l>They could not let Him leave them thus,</l><l>The Stranger was their Friend:</l><l>Draw near, O Lord.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
